    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/eef576c552792ca0a5003dd2db08c7ed.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2398, a network of intelligent computers known as <strong>Nightgate</strong>, is the last remaining life form on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/0b38eddd878ed177f4ef98a4acbe244e.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through hostile systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bullets and evade threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/abdb51267ebf893cd5253686f372d3c2.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from an obsession with sci-fi interfaces and HUDs, Nightgate brings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living digital architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic structures that build as you move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique environments where no two levels are alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/25bf19c5f241d37e798a4efaf4fa16ef.avif?t=1755195124\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/d1f236e85614fb5bf448c0584fac7e3e.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game camera to capture the beauty of the digital realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause. Snap. Save. Share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/3d21af8c452708200b730013470863cf.avif?t=1755195124\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/6769ba1f4b494731bdf1f40e1d79d435.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive soundscape blending deep synths, shadowy pads, and minimal piano. Composed in tandem with the gameplay for a unified, cinematic feel.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/e49f512d09ba62c29989494e01dfffcd.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/eef576c552792ca0a5003dd2db08c7ed.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2398, a network of intelligent computers known as <strong>Nightgate</strong>, is the last remaining life form on Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/169cf11f9f54e5e247e3da5f6bf32fd3.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/0b38eddd878ed177f4ef98a4acbe244e.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weave through hostile systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bullets and evade threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.poster.avif?t=1755195124\" width=610 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.webm?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/27f0cff634a872ed6214b2ac4c02bccc.mp4?t=1755195124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/abdb51267ebf893cd5253686f372d3c2.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from an obsession with sci-fi interfaces and HUDs, Nightgate brings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living digital architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic structures that build as you move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique environments where no two levels are alike</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/25bf19c5f241d37e798a4efaf4fa16ef.avif?t=1755195124\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/d1f236e85614fb5bf448c0584fac7e3e.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game camera to capture the beauty of the digital realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause. Snap. Save. Share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/3d21af8c452708200b730013470863cf.avif?t=1755195124\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836180/extras/6769ba1f4b494731bdf1f40e1d79d435.avif?t=1755195124\" width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive soundscape blending deep synths, shadowy pads, and minimal piano. Composed in tandem with the gameplay for a unified, cinematic feel.</p>",
